      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "La vez pasada, Tū se vengó de sus hermanos, y Rūaumoko quedó en lo hondo de la tierra.",
          "en": "Last time, Tū took his revenge on his brothers, and Rūaumoko was left deep under the earth."
        },
        {
          "es": "Ahora el mundo tenía luz, bosques, mar y comida.",
          "en": "Now the world had light, forests, sea, and food."
        },
        {
          "es": "Pero Tāne, dios de los bosques, sentía que algo faltaba.",
          "en": "But Tāne, god of the forests, felt that something was missing."
        },
        {
          "es": "Esta historia la publicó John White en la década de 1880, de los relatos de muchas tribus.",
          "en": "This story was published by John White in the 1880s, from the tellings of many tribes."
        },
        {
          "es": "Y como todas estas historias, cada tribu la cuenta un poco distinto.",
          "en": "And like all these stories, each tribe tells it a little differently."
        }
      ],
